        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Fertility history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "The patient and partner have been trying to conceive for approximately 18 months without conception."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Intercourse frequency"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Intercourse approximately once every 2–3 weeks; the patient attributes this to rotating shifts and low sex drive."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Libido"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gradually reduced libido over the last 1–2 years; remains low since stopping testosterone gel."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Erectile function"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reduced morning erections and erections described as less robust; usually able to achieve penetration."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Associated genitourinary symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies ejaculatory pain, haematospermia, lower urinary tract symptoms, dysuria, frequency, nocturia, haematuria, testicular pain, and noticed testicular lumps."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Previously reported semen analysis"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "At a fertility clinic approximately 4 months ago, semen count and motility were reportedly described as borderline to low; the report and details are not available. The test was while or soon after testosterone therapy."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Previously reported testosterone result"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "A fertility clinic reportedly described testosterone as on the low side; results are not available."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Well appearing, no acute distress, described as fit looking."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Virilisation and endocrine examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Normal male-pattern facial and body hair, deep voice, normal muscle bulk, and no gynaecomastia."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-16",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Abdominal examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Abdomen soft and non-tender."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-17",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-17",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Genital examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Penis normal with no lesions or discharge. Testes bilaterally descended, firm, non-tender, approximately 18–20 mL by palpation, with no masses and no obvious varicocele on standing or Valsalva. Epididymides normal; no inguinal hernia."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-18",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-18",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Grossly non-focal."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-19",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-19",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Relevant medical and reproductive history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports prior diagnosis of androgen deficiency by a GP approximately 12 months ago; details and prior results are unclear. Denies anabolic steroid use, mumps orchitis, testicular trauma or torsion, hernia repair, chemotherapy or radiotherapy, known varicocele, and prior sexually transmitted infections."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-20",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-20",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Psychological symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports some stress and guilt regarding fertility and sexual performance. Denies low mood, anhedonia, and functional decline; sleep is okay, enjoys hobbies, and is coping at work. Denies suicidal ideation."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-21",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-21",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Weight change"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports approximately 8 kg weight gain over approximately 3 years, mostly central."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-22",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-22",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Lifestyle and substance use history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No smoking. Alcohol 4–6 standard drinks per week, rarely more. No current recreational drug use; remote cannabis use in early 20s. Diet high in takeaway food and minimal structured exercise."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/MedicationStatement/medication-statement-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "MedicationStatement",
        "id": "medication-statement-1",
        "status": "stopped",
        "medicationCodeableConcept": {
          "text": "Testosterone gel"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Previously used for a few months after a prior GP diagnosis of androgen deficiency; stopped approximately 4–5 months ago after the fertility clinic advised it could reduce sperm count."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
